Package: worldcuphost
Title: Measure Home Advantage for FIFA World Cup Host Nations
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Gopika", "Nair", , "gopikanair2026@u.northwestern.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for measuring whether countries perform better when they
    host the FIFA World Cup. Includes a dataset of every men's World Cup
    match and functions that find the years a country hosted and compare
    its results as host versus non-host, such as win percentage and goals
    per game.
